#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1850
msgid ""
"SINGLE: SP value to cross down (stack overflow detect).\n"
"WINDOW: Lower bound of allowed SP range."
msgstr ""
"SINGLE : Valeur SP à franchir vers le bas (détection de débordement de "
"pile).\n"
"WINDOW : Borne inférieure de la plage SP autorisée."

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1854
#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2425
#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/heatmap/mhmap_window.cpp:665
#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/watch/watch_window.cpp:443
msgid "Mode:"
msgstr "Mode :"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1856
msgid ""
"Single = trigger when SP descends through SP Threshold (stack overflow "
"detect, default V1).\n"
"Window = trigger when SP leaves [Lower..Upper] range (stack corruption / "
"cross-task switch detect).\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/match-modes.md"
msgstr ""
"Single = déclenche quand SP descend sous SP Threshold (détection de "
"débordement de pile, défaut V1).\n"
"Window = déclenche quand SP quitte la plage [Lower..Upper] (détection de "
"corruption de pile / commutation entre tâches).\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/match-modes.md"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1866
msgid "Upper bound:"
msgstr "Borne supérieure :"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1875
msgid ""
"Upper SP value of the allowed window. Lower = SP Threshold. Trigger fires on "
"transition from inside [Lower..Upper] to outside. Edge-triggered: pre-"
"existing outside SP at startup will not spam - waits for transition.\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/match-modes.md"
msgstr ""
"Valeur SP supérieure de la fenêtre autorisée. Lower = SP Threshold. "
"Déclenche sur transition de l'intérieur [Lower..Upper] vers l'extérieur. "
"Edge-triggered : un SP déjà hors fenêtre au démarrage ne spamme pas - attend "
"une transition.\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/match-modes.md"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1901
msgid "IRQ - CPU acknowledged INT (post-dispatch)"
msgstr "IRQ - INT acquitté par le CPU (post-dispatch)"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1905
msgid "IM modes:"
msgstr "Modes IM :"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1908
msgid "IM 0##bpt_irq_im0_en"
msgstr "IM 0##bpt_irq_im0_en"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1912
msgid "IM 1##bpt_irq_im1_en"
msgstr "IM 1##bpt_irq_im1_en"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1916
msgid "IM 2##bpt_irq_im2_en"
msgstr "IM 2##bpt_irq_im2_en"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1920
msgid ""
"Choose Z80 interrupt modes to monitor. At least one must be selected. BP "
"fires only when CPU dispatches in an enabled mode. Each enabled IM mode "
"reveals its own sub-filter section below.\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/irq-filter.md"
msgstr ""
"Sélectionnez les modes d'interruption Z80 à surveiller. Au moins un doit "
"être sélectionné. Le BP déclenche uniquement quand le CPU dispatche dans un "
"mode activé. Chaque mode IM activé révèle sa propre section de sous-filtre "
"ci-dessous.\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/irq-filter.md"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1934
msgid "IM 0 RST filter (none = match all):"
msgstr "Filtre IM 0 RST (aucun = matche tout) :"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1936
msgid ""
"Filter triggers by RST opcode pushed on the bus during IM 0 dispatch. Empty "
"(no checkbox set) = match all RSTs (legacy V1 behavior). Mask bit i matches "
"RST opcode (0xC7 + i*8).\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/irq-filter.md"
msgstr ""
"Filtre les déclenchements par opcode RST envoyé sur le bus pendant le "
"dispatch IM 0. Vide (aucune case cochée) = matche tous les RST (comportement "
"legacy V1). Le bit i du masque matche l'opcode RST (0xC7 + i*8).\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/irq-filter.md"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1995
msgid "IM 1 always dispatches RST 38h (no extra filter)"
msgstr "IM 1 dispatche toujours RST 38h (pas de filtre supplémentaire)"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1997
msgid ""
"In IM 1 the Z80 always dispatches via RST 38h. There are no per-vector or "
"per-source sub-filters available - if IM 1 is enabled, every IM 1 dispatch "
"will fire the BP (subject to other BP rules - condition, hits, skip).\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/irq-filter.md"
msgstr ""
"En IM 1 le Z80 dispatche toujours via RST 38h. Aucun sous-filtre par vecteur "
"ou par source n'est disponible - si IM 1 est activé, chaque dispatch IM 1 "
"déclenchera le BP (sous réserve des autres règles BP - condition, hits, "
"skip).\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/irq-filter.md"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2013
msgid "IM 2 sub-filters:"
msgstr "Sous-filtres IM 2 :"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2020
msgid "Filter by IM2 vector address##bpt_irq_vec_en"
msgstr "Filtrer par adresse de vecteur IM2##bpt_irq_vec_en"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2023
msgid ""
"Filter triggers only when CPU dispatches IM2 INT through this exact vector "
"slot. Vector address is computed as (I register << 8) | (low byte from "
"peripheral & 0xFE). Comparison applies AND with 0xFE on bit 0 (= HW vector "
"page boundary), so user value bit 0 is ignored at runtime.\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/irq-filter.md"
msgstr ""
"Filtre les déclenchements uniquement quand le CPU dispatche un INT IM2 par "
"exactement ce slot de vecteur. L'adresse de vecteur est calculée comme "
"(registre I << 8) | (octet bas du périphérique & 0xFE). La comparaison "
"applique AND avec 0xFE sur le bit 0 (= limite de page vecteur HW), donc le "
"bit 0 de la valeur utilisateur est ignoré à l'exécution.\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/irq-filter.md"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2035
msgid "IM2 Vector:"
msgstr "Vecteur IM2 :"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2051
msgid "Vector Match Mode:"
msgstr "Mode correspondance vecteur :"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2054
msgid ""
"Single = trigger on exact vector address (default V1.5).\n"
"Range  = trigger when vector within [Vector..End] inclusive.\n"
"Mask   = trigger when (vector & Mask) == (Vector & Mask).\n"
"         Useful for matching vector page slots.\n"
"Note: HW page boundary mask 0xFFFE is applied to both user value and runtime "
"vector before comparison.\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/irq-filter.md"
msgstr ""
"Single = déclenche sur adresse de vecteur exacte (défaut V1.5).\n"
"Range  = déclenche quand le vecteur est dans [Vector..End] inclus.\n"
"Mask   = déclenche quand (vector & Mask) == (Vector & Mask).\n"
"         Utile pour matcher des slots de page de vecteur.\n"
"Note : le masque de limite de page HW 0xFFFE est appliqué à la valeur "
"utilisateur et au vecteur runtime avant comparaison.\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/irq-filter.md"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2066
msgid "Vector End:"
msgstr "Fin vecteur :"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2076
msgid ""
"Upper bound for RANGE match (inclusive). Active only when Vector Match Mode "
"= Range."
msgstr ""
"Borne supérieure pour matching RANGE (inclusive). Actif uniquement quand "
"Vector Match Mode = Range."

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2082
msgid "Vector Mask:"
msgstr "Masque vecteur :"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2092
msgid ""
"AND mask for MASK match. Trigger when (vector & Mask) == (Vector & Mask). "
"Default 0xFFFF = identical to Single mode. Example: Vector=0xFE10, "
"Mask=0xFFE0 triggers on any vector in 0xFE00..0xFE1F page slot range."
msgstr ""
"Masque AND pour matching MASK. Déclenche quand (vector & Mask) == (Vector & "
"Mask). Défaut 0xFFFF = identique au mode Single. Exemple : Vector=0xFE10, "
"Mask=0xFFE0 déclenche sur tout vecteur dans la plage 0xFE00..0xFE1F du slot "
"de page."

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2105
msgid "Filter by IM2 ISR address##bpt_irq_isr_en"
msgstr "Filtrer par adresse ISR IM2##bpt_irq_isr_en"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2108
msgid ""
"Filter triggers only when CPU jumps to this ISR after IM2 dispatch. ISR "
"address is read by CPU from the IM2 vector table during dispatch.\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/irq-filter.md"
msgstr ""
"Filtre les déclenchements uniquement quand le CPU saute à cette ISR après "
"dispatch IM2. L'adresse ISR est lue par le CPU depuis la table de vecteurs "
"IM2 pendant le dispatch.\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/irq-filter.md"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2114
msgid "IM2 ISR:"
msgstr "ISR IM2 :"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2128
msgid "ISR Match Mode:"
msgstr "Mode correspondance ISR :"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2131
msgid ""
"Single = trigger on exact ISR address (default V1.5).\n"
"Range  = trigger when ISR within [ISR..End] inclusive.\n"
"Mask   = trigger when (isr & Mask) == (ISR & Mask).\n"
"         Useful for matching ISR memory regions.\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/irq-filter.md"
msgstr ""
"Single = déclenche sur adresse ISR exacte (défaut V1.5).\n"
"Range  = déclenche quand ISR est dans [ISR..End] inclus.\n"
"Mask   = déclenche quand (isr & Mask) == (ISR & Mask).\n"
"         Utile pour matcher des régions mémoire ISR.\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/irq-filter.md"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2141
msgid "ISR End:"
msgstr "Fin ISR :"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2151
msgid ""
"Upper bound for RANGE match (inclusive). Active only when ISR Match Mode = "
"Range."
msgstr ""
"Borne supérieure pour matching RANGE (inclusive). Actif uniquement quand ISR "
"Match Mode = Range."

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2157
msgid "ISR Mask:"
msgstr "Masque ISR :"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2167
msgid ""
"AND mask for MASK match. Trigger when (isr & Mask) == (ISR & Mask). Default "
"0xFFFF = identical to Single mode."
msgstr ""
"Masque AND pour matching MASK. Déclenche quand (isr & Mask) == (ISR & Mask). "
"Défaut 0xFFFF = identique au mode Single."

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2188
msgid "IRQ_SIG - peripheral INT line raise (pre-dispatch)"
msgstr "IRQ_SIG - activation de ligne INT périphérique (pre-dispatch)"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2192
msgid "Sources:"
msgstr "Sources :"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2196
msgid "(at least one required, OR semantics)"
msgstr "(au moins un requis, sémantique OR)"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2198
msgid ""
"Choose peripheral INT line sources to monitor (pre-dispatch). PIOZ80 PORT_A/"
"B = Z80 PIO chip interrupts. CTC2 = CTC channel 2 (timer/counter). FDC = "
"floppy disk controller (WD279x). Other = other unrecognized INT sources (bus "
"latch). Multi-source BP fires when ANY selected source raises (OR "
"semantics).\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/irq-sig.md"
msgstr ""
"Sélectionnez les sources de ligne INT périphérique à surveiller (pre-"
"dispatch). PIOZ80 PORT_A/B = interruptions du chip Z80 PIO. CTC2 = canal CTC "
"2 (timer/compteur). FDC = contrôleur de disquette (WD279x). Other = autres "
"sources INT non reconnues (bus latch). Un BP multi-source déclenche quand "
"N'IMPORTE QUELLE source sélectionnée s'active (sémantique OR).\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/irq-sig.md"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2266
msgid "Global BP - fires when condition is true (per-instruction probe)"
msgstr ""
"BP Global - déclenche quand la condition est vraie (sonde à chaque "
"instruction)"

