#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/sections/dbg_profiler.cpp:1168
msgid ""
"Total on_enter events (CALL + RST + IRQ + NMI accepts)\n"
"since last Reset. = sum of Calls column."
msgstr ""
"Total des évènements on_enter (acceptations CALL + RST + IRQ + NMI)\n"
"depuis le dernier Reset. = somme de la colonne Calls."

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/sections/dbg_profiler.cpp:1178
msgid ""
"How many of 'Calls' were IRQ or NMI accept events\n"
"(= IM 0 / IM 1 / IM 2 / NMI, not CALL or RST)."
msgstr ""
"Combien de 'Calls' étaient des évènements d'acceptation IRQ ou NMI\n"
"(= IM 0 / IM 1 / IM 2 / NMI, pas CALL ni RST)."

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/sections/dbg_profiler.cpp:1188
msgid ""
"RET / RETI / RETN events with no paired CALL in shadow\n"
"stack ('divergent returns').\n"
"\n"
"Causes:\n"
"  - PUSH addr + RET trampoline (BDOS dispatch tables)\n"
"  - longjmp pattern (restore SP and RET)\n"
"  - self-modifying return address on stack\n"
"  - ISR ending with RET instead of RETI\n"
"\n"
"Profiler skips these in aggregation (no paired enter).\n"
"\n"
"0 or a few = OK, data trustworthy.\n"
"Growing steadily = multi-stack OS pattern (CP/M, NIPOS)\n"
"= V1 measurements NOT accurate, waiting on callstack\n"
"V1.5+ scope BPs."
msgstr ""
"Évènements RET / RETI / RETN sans CALL apparié dans le shadow\n"
"stack ('retours divergents').\n"
"\n"
"Causes :\n"
"  - trampoline PUSH addr + RET (tables de dispatch BDOS)\n"
"  - motif longjmp (restaurer SP et RET)\n"
"  - adresse de retour automodifiante sur la pile\n"
"  - ISR se terminant par RET au lieu de RETI\n"
"\n"
"Le profileur les ignore dans l'agrégation (pas d'enter apparié).\n"
"\n"
"0 ou quelques-uns = OK, données fiables.\n"
"Croissance régulière = motif OS multi-stack (CP/M, NIPOS)\n"
"= mesures V1 NON précises, attente des BPs scope\n"
"callstack V1.5+."

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/sections/dbg_profiler.cpp:1211
msgid ""
"Unique (target_addr, kind) entries in the aggregator.\n"
"Each bucket = one row in the table.\n"
"\n"
"A bucket is created at first entry to that\n"
"(address, kind) combination. Cleared only by Reset.\n"
"\n"
"Typical Z80 game / demo: tens to hundreds.\n"
"Thousands and growing = SMC or banked code mixing\n"
"into the same buckets, data may be misleading.\n"
"\n"
"Memory cost: ~64 B per bucket."
msgstr ""
"Entrées (target_addr, kind) uniques dans l'agrégateur.\n"
"Chaque bucket = une ligne dans la table.\n"
"\n"
"Un bucket est créé à la première entrée dans cette\n"
"combinaison (adresse, kind). Effacé uniquement par Reset.\n"
"\n"
"Jeu/démo Z80 typique : dizaines à centaines.\n"
"Milliers et croissant = SMC ou code banké mélangeant\n"
"dans les mêmes buckets, données potentiellement trompeuses.\n"
"\n"
"Coût mémoire : ~64 B par bucket."

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/sections/dbg_profiler.cpp:1233
msgid ""
"Parallel stack push beyond PROFILER_MAX_DEPTH (256).\n"
"Extreme nesting depth - shouldn't happen in normal Z80\n"
"code. Investigate or Reset."
msgstr ""
"Push parallèle au-delà de PROFILER_MAX_DEPTH (256).\n"
"Profondeur d'imbrication extrême - ne devrait pas arriver\n"
"en code Z80 normal. Investiguez ou faites Reset."

